  excerpt: `Part 2: What a geologist accidentally built while trying to stop AI from being confidently wrong. By Arif Fazil Geoscientist, Penang In Part 1, I said something that sounded a bit dramatic. That as a geologist, I may have accidentally built an intell...`,
